es</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-prose leading-relaxed">Las comisiones del banco corren por tu cuenta, no por la de RevolFlash. Recibirás el importe solicitado menos esas comisiones: si pides $50.00, pueden llegarte, por ejemplo, $48.90.</p></div></div></details></section><section aria-labelledby="tus-solicitudes"><h2 id="tus-solicitudes" class="font-medium text-text">Tus solicitudes</h2><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 hidden gap-3 px-4 text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase md:grid md:grid-cols-[6.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_6rem_6.5rem_1rem]"><span>Fecha</span><span>Método</span><span class="text-right">Importe</span><span>Estado</span><span></span></div><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 md:mt-2"><li><details class="group rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md open:border-line"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-3 p-4 md:grid md:gap-3 md:grid-cols-[6.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_6rem_6.5rem_1rem] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="hidden text-sm text-text-dim tabular-nums md:block">1 mar 2026</span><span class="min-w-[5.5rem] text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text md:order-3 md:min-w-0 md:text-right">$60.00</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-xs text-text-dim md:order-2 md:text-sm md:whitespace-normal">Cuenta bancaria ····1332</span><span class="shrink-0 justify-self-start rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs font-medium md:order-4 border-line text-text-dim">Pendiente</span><span class="shrink-0 text-text-dim transition-transform duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical group-open:rotate-90 md:order-5" aria-hidden="true">›</span></summary><div class="border-t border-line p-4"><div class="relative mt-1 mb-5 flex items-start justify-between"><span class="absolute top-[11px] right-[8%] left-[8%] h-px bg-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute top-[11px] left-[8%] h-px bg-ok transition-[width] duration-[var(--df-dur-slow)] ease-mech