iv><div class=""><label for="importe" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-text">Importe</label><div class="relative"><input id="importe" class="min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-sm border bg-surface px-3.5 text-base text-text placeholder:text-text-dim focus:bg-raised  border-line focus:border-text" inputmode="decimal" value=""></div></div><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-text-dim">Mínimo $50.00 · disponible $90.00</p></div><div><label for="metodo" class="mb-1.5 block text-sm font-medium text-text">A dónde</label><select id="metodo" class="min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 text-base text-text focus:bg-raised"><option value="m1">Cuenta bancaria ····1332</option><option value="m2">Cuenta bancaria ····9876</option></select></div><button type="submit" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-action text-void border-transparent hover:brightness-110 w-full sm:w-auto" disabled="">Pedir cobro</button></form><section aria-labelledby="donde-cobrar"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><h2 id="donde-cobrar" class="font-medium text-text">Dónde cobrar</h2><span class="rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase">2 métodos</span></div><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-raised text-text-dim"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h18M5 10v8m4-8v8m6-8v8m4-8v8M3 18h18M12 3 3 7.5h18L12 3Z"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-[9rem] flex-1"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-text">Cuenta bancaria</span><span class="block font-mono text-xs text-text-dim">····1332</span></span><span class="ml-auto flex shrink-0 gap-1"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised ">Reemplazar</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised ">Borrar</button></span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 p-4 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md"><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-sm bg-raised text-text-dim"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h18M5 10v8m4-8v8m6-8v8m4-8v8M3 18h18M12 3 3 7.5h18L12 3Z"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-[9rem] flex-1"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-text">Cuenta bancaria</span><span class="block font-mono text-xs text-text-dim">····9876</span></span><span class="ml-auto flex shrink-0 gap-1"><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised ">Reemplazar</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition-[filter,background-color,border-color] duration-150 ease-mechanical disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 disabled:hover:brightness-100 disabled:hover:bg-transparent bg-transparent text-text border-transparent hover:bg-raised ">Borrar</button></span></li></ul><button type="button" class="mt-2 w-full rounded-sm border border-dashed border-line p-4 text-sm font-medium text-text-dim transition-colors duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical hover:bg-raised hover:text-text">+ Añadir método de cobro</button><p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-xs leading-relaxed text-text-dim">Se guardan cifrados; el equipo solo los ve al procesar un cobro tuyo.</p></section></div><div class="mt-10 min-w-0 space-y-10 xl:mt-0"><section aria-labelledby="info-cobro"><h2 id="info-cobro" class="sr-only">Información sobre los cobros</h2><details class="group rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 backdrop-blur-md"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 p-4 text-sm font-medium text-text [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Cómo funciona el cobro y las comisiones<span class="text-text-dim transition-transform duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical group-open:rotate-90" aria-hidden="true">›</span></summary><div class="space-y-4 border-t border-line p-4 text-sm text-text-dim"><div><h3 class="font-medium text-text">Cómo funciona</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-prose leading-relaxed">Al pedir un cobro, ese importe sale de tu saldo al momento, el equipo lo revisa y te lo envía por el método que elijas. Puede tardar unos días. Si lo rechazamos, el dinero vuelve entero a tu monedero.</p></div><div><h3 class="font-medium text-text">Comisiones</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-prose leading-relaxed">Las comisiones del banco corren por tu cuenta, no por la de RevolFlash. Recibirás el importe solicitado menos esas comisiones: si pides $50.00, pueden llegarte, por ejemplo, $48.90.</p></div></div></details></section><section aria-labelledby="tus-solicitudes"><h2 id="tus-solicitudes" class="font-medium text-text">Tus solicitudes</h2><div aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 hidden gap-3 px-4 text-2xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-text-dim uppercase md:grid md:grid-cols-[6.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_6rem_6.5rem_1rem]"><span>Fecha</span><span>Método</span><span class="text-right">Importe</span><span>Estado</span><span></span></div><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 md:mt-2"><li><details class="group rounded-sm border border-line bg-surface/60 shadow-[var(--df-shadow-sm)] backdrop-blur-md open:border-line"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-3 p-4 md:grid md:gap-3 md:grid-cols-[6.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)_6rem_6.5rem_1rem] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="hidden text-sm text-text-dim tabular-nums md:block">1 mar 2026</span><span class="min-w-[5.5rem] text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-text md:order-3 md:min-w-0 md:text-right">$60.00</span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-xs text-text-dim md:order-2 md:text-sm md:whitespace-normal">Cuenta bancaria ····1332</span><span class="shrink-0 justify-self-start rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-2xs font-medium md:order-4 border-line text-text-dim">Pendiente</span><span class="shrink-0 text-text-dim transition-transform duration-[var(--df-dur-fast)] ease-mechanical group-open:rotate-90 md:order-5" aria-hidden="true">›</span></summary><div class="border-t border-line p-4"><div class="relative mt-1 mb-5 flex items-start justify-between"><span class="absolute top-[11px] right-[8%] left-[8%] h-px bg-line" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="absolute top-[11px] left-[8%] h-px bg-ok transition-[width] duration-[var(--df-dur-slow)] ea